WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.252 --> 00:00:02.291
You told me he was out for the season

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:03.778
We broke his collarbone and sacked the

00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:04.750
State Farm Dog

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.375
No man can come back from that

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:08.875
This is not a man we're talking about

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.125
This is AARON...RODGERS

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.125
Didn't finish the job?

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:14.041
God help the NFC

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:20.000
Mr. Rodgers, welcome back to the Elite Hotel

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:21.291
Your pinnie, sir

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:23.125
Rodgers! You're back!

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:24.500
How many years has it been?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.625
Seven weeks. I'm coming for you

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.833
I'm coming for the wild card

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:32.416
Ah, ah, hotel rules. Can't hit a QB in a pinnie

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.083
Are you here on business, Peppers?

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.958
Afraid so, old friend

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.166
Hut, hut

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.541
[Hail Mary, it's a Hail Mary!]

00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:47.899
[Rodgers with another Hail Mary!]

00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:49.666
Packers have a highly improbable

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.458
route to the playoffs. Why is he doing this?!

00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:55.583
Because he's Baba Yaga — The Boogeyman

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:59.083
♫ Like a good neighbor, Rodgers is- ♫

00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:00.083
Here

